effect:** 95–120 Hz clustering is dimensionally inevitable (§2). Any cross-domain hypothesis should test *which specific mode* (order, symmetry class, degeneracy structure) matches, not the bare frequency.
8. **Coupled systems:** Newgrange chamber+passage and the Hypogeum network are multi-cavity resonators — single-box tables are the 0th-order model; measured spectra will show hybridized/split modes.

